# ── mela-letterhead intermediates and output ──────────────────
# Rewritten on every build; `build --keep-build` is what leaves them behind.
.letterhead-build/
# A build writes its PDF beside the source, so running the scaffold anywhere in
# the tree drops one here. Nothing this project ships is a PDF.
*.pdf
# What `mela-letterhead init .` writes if it is ever run at the repo root — the
# obvious way to try a change by hand. Every one of these, or trying the tool
# leaves untracked files behind for the next `git add -A` to sweep up. Keep it
# in step with `cli.command_init`: `assets/` here is the repo's own directory,
# holding the README screenshots, so the scaffold's files are named rather than
# the directory ignored.
/letterhead.yaml
/letterhead.schema.json
/example-letter.md
/assets/logo.*
/assets/plate-*.svg

